\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Sinners, obey the gospel word;
\par Haste to the supper of my Lord!
\par Be wise to know your gracious day;
\par All things are ready, come away!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Ready the Father is to own
\par And kiss His late-returning son;
\par Ready your loving Saviour stands,
\par And spreads for you His bleeding hands.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Ready the Spirit of His love
\par Just now the hardness to remove,
\par To apply, and witness with the blood,
\par And wash and seal the sons of God.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Ready for you the angels wait,
\par T triumph in your blest estate;
\par Tuning their harps, they long to praise
\par The wonders of redeeming grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. The Father, Son, and Holy Ghost
\par Is ready, with the shining host;
\par All heaven is ready to resound :
\par The dead's alive, the lost is found!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

